  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每回合只选择一张卡，就能持续拼接出意外且不同的人生故事。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In this game, you can craft a fascinating, surprising, and memorable life story with the simplest operation—just choosing one card per turn.",
