      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "年龄增长会进入不同人生阶段，同一阶段的决定可能彻底改写后续轨迹。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "For instance, as you age, you'll need to face various [stages] of choices, where different decisions could completely alter your life's trajectory.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393750/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "徽章升级会增加人生选项，并让原有玩法发生分化或转向。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "When your [badges] level up, the choices and gameplay in life will become even more diverse or take a different turn.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393750/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
